Hi there, 

Maddie here from Originality.AI

We wanted to chat with you today about our recently
launchedFact-Checking Tool! 

We wanted to express our sincere gratitude for your thoughtful feedback
and input since its launch a couple of weeks ago-  Your insights are so
incredibly helpful in shaping our roadmap and guiding our efforts to
make this tool more impactful for you! 

Based on your feedback- we'd like to share some of the key areas that
we are actively working on improving: 

* 

**More Intelligent Fact Identification:**We understand that the accuracy
of fact-checking heavily depends on identifying the right claims to
fact-check. We are investing in improving the tool's ability to
intelligently select and prioritize claims for fact-checking, which will
help us focus on the most impactful and relevant topics for your use
case.

* 

**Increased Consistency of Answers:**Consistency is key when it comes to
these types of tools. We are diligently working on enhancing the tool's
algorithms to provide more consistent answers and sourcing. 

* 

**Cost Reduction:** We are pleased to share that with advancements in AI
technology, the costs associated with running our tool have begun to
decrease. We are actively exploring opportunities to pass these savings
onto our users and make fact-checking more affordable/accessible to
everyone.

* 

**Driving Up Accuracy:** While we have been able to achieve more
accurate fact-checking results
than the
alternative AI's, we are aware that our accuracy needs to continue
to improve. We are dedicated to pushing the boundaries and driving up
the accuracy of our tool . We aim to be a gold standard fact-checking
solution and are already working hard behind the scenes on our next
release! 

Your feedback has been an essential part of our journey from the get
go! We will continue to monitor the feedback questionnaire, so please
take the time to share your thoughts with us so that we can serve you
better. 

Fact-Checking Feedback Form 

Stay tuned for more updates as we make progress on these important
initiatives. We are excited about the path ahead and look forward to
your continued involvement.

Have a great day!

Sent to: patriogabrielpatdu@gmail.com

Unsubscribe 

Jon Gillham, 1 First Street Suite #220, Collingwood, Ontario L9Y 1A1, Canada
